messages:
Yara: Quick SEO handoff for tomorrow's webinar page — need keywords, redirect rules for old promos, JSON-LD snippet, anchor suggestions, and UTMs for routing. 24h timeline.
Liam: I can do keywords + anchors. Primary KWs: 'scalable LLM inference', 'low-latency LLM serving'. Supporting: 'inference batching', 'LLM production patterns'. Hero H1: 'Scalable, Low-Latency LLM Serving'.
Nikhil: I'll handle redirects/canonical. Legacy paths: /promo/edge2025 and /events/edge-demo -> 301 to /webinars/serving-llms-2026. No JS redirects.
Nikhil: nginx snippet for infra PR:
```
location = /promo/edge2025 {
  return 301 /webinars/serving-llms-2026;
}
location = /events/edge-demo {
  return 301 /webinars/serving-llms-2026;
}
```
Liam: Anchor plan: Blog -> 'real-world latency wins', Benchmarks -> 'throughput benchmarks', Docs -> 'integration guide', Footer -> 'register for webinar'. Keep anchors natural.
Yara: JSON-LD to paste in head (exact string in CMS): {"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Event","name":"Redwood Inference Webinar: Serving LLMs in Production","startDate":"2026-06-26T18:00:00Z","location":{"@type":"VirtualLocation","url":"https://redwood.ai/webinars/serving-llms-2026"},"organizer":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Redwood Inference"}}
cms-bot: scan: 4 promo pages missing Event schema; recommend adding Event JSON-LD on landing and FAQ schema on Qs.
Yara: UTMs: utm_source=marcom, utm_medium=email|social|partner, utm_campaign=serving_llms_jun2026. Sales to map utm_campaign -> CRM campaign field.
Nikhil: I'll open infra PR with redirects and canonical headers, tag infra-oncall for deploy slot.
Liam: Uploading hero copy + KW list to CMS now.
Yara: Thanks — aim to have PR and CMS changes done by EOD and post confirmation here. :thumbsup:
